  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that multimodal models with multiprofile settings, scvi_n200 RNA encoder, and weighted fusion achieve high accuracy (e.g., config_031: 0.6776). This experiment tests replacing the image encoder (resnet50 → imagenet_vit_l) and aggregation method (avgpool → transformer) to explore if combining a more powerful image encoder with transformer-based aggregation further improves performance. This clarifies the impact of these design choices on accuracy, prioritizing exploitation of the promising scvi_n200 RNA encoder while exploring potential gains from advanced image processing."
